assumption = "The launchpad workspace owner repairs the manifest/toolchain agreement; this task does not rerun or bypass the recorded unrelated failure and claims no build or verification pass."
resolved = "Prerequisite 22.31.461 is done on continuation base 117197c811684e097104c96b29e872d45034cebb; services/launchpad/go.work now declares Go 1.27.0. The current attempt qualifies the preserved repairs with the shared workspace enabled."

